<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! engine.home.verifies ~ the the operator's homes tunnel's loads, as each host reports them

`lares home verify` asks what each host reports loading (the seed once per host) and writes nothing. `--probe` runs the hosts' own probe where one stands.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ verify · probe

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`verify` params=`~ read each host's loads`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`probe` params=`probe/true ~ run the hosts' own probe`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ familiar · probe

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`familiar` params=`takes/pet-name ~ the familiar whose hooks a home tend seats; absent, the one already seated stands`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`probe` params=`~ run each host's own load probe`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ local

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`local` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ reads this host's files; this handler checks no ocap`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · root-repo-only · staged-repo-read-only

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`~ name one of read, tend, verify, undo`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`root-repo-only` params=`~ --root names a checkout, and only lares repo keeps one`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`staged-repo-read-only` params=`~ --staged reads the index, and only lares repo read reads it`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ loads-once · off

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`loads-once` params=`exit/0 fields/[[radius ok lines]] ~ every host loads the seed once`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`off` params=`exit/1 fields/[[radius ok lines]] ~ a host's loads read off the tunnel`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

